~ mum
if Story.flag("got_starter")
	Mum: Your partner looks happy. Come home and rest whenever you need to.
else
	Mum: Off you go! The professor wanted to see you.
=> END

~ kid
Kid: The tall grass is where the wild ones hide. I'm not allowed in yet.
=> END

~ elder
Elder: Creatures you treat well fight better for you. Mark my words.
=> END

~ nurse
Nurse: Rest your team at the counter whenever you like.
=> END

~ clerk
Clerk: Cages, nets, salves. Step up to the counter to buy.
=> END
